{"car": [{"id": "car", "headword": "चर्", "headword_slp1": "car", "fold": "car", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "चर् vt. 1P (pp. चरित; pres. चरति) 1. To go, to walk, to wander, कृष्णसारस्तु चरति मृगो यत्र स्वभावतः M.ii.23, कपयश्चेरुरार्तस्य रामस्येव मनोरथाः R.xii.59, M.vi.68, x.55; 2. to behave towards, to act towards, प्रदक्षिणक्रियार्हायां तस्यां त्वं साधु नाचरः R.i.76; 3. to continue to be, to live, विहाय कामान् यः सर्वान्मुपांश्चरति निस्पृहः Bg.ii.71, 4. to practise, to perform, Yaj.i.60, M.iii.30; 5. to graze; 6. to eat.With अति-, 1. to transgress, to disobey; 2. to offend.With अनु-, to follow.With अन्वा-, to imitate.With अप-, to disregard.With अभि-, to deceive, to betray, M.v.162; 2. to conjure, तथैवाभिचरत्रपि Yaj.i.295.With आ-, 1. to wander over or about; 2. to act or behave towards, पुत्रं मित्रवदाचरेत् Cāṇakya.; 3. to practise, to perform, to do, नाचरेत्किंचिदप्रियम् M.v.156, or न चाप्याचरितः पूर्वैरयं धर्मः Bh. With उद्-, 1. to arise, to originate, दिव्यस्तूर्यध्वनिरुदचरत् R.xvi.87, उच्चचार निनर्दोंभसि तस्याः ix.73; 2. to void one’s excrement, तिरस्कृत्योचरेत् काष्ठलोष्ठपत्रतृणादिना M.iv.49; 3. to utter, to pronounce, अन्यदा जगति राम इयत्यं शब्द उच्चरित एव मामगात् R.xi.73; 4. to go up, to ascend, Na.v.48; 5. (in the Atm. and trans.) to stray away from, to transgress, e.g. धर्ममुच्चरते.With उप-, to serve, to wait upon, सममुपचरं भद्रे सुप्रियं वाऽप्रियं वा Mrich.i., R.v.62, K.S.i.60; 5. to treat medically; 6. to approach.With दुस्-, to deceive.With परि-, 1. to go about; 2. to serve, to wait upon, M.ii.243; 3. to nurse, to take care of.With प्र-, 1. to walk about, to stalk; 2. to spread, to be prevalent; 3. to prevail as a custom; 4. to proceed to work.With वि-, 1. to wander through or about; 2. to practice, to perform.With व्यभि-, 1. to be faithless, to go astray; 2. to act crookedly.With सम्-, (Par. and Atm.) 1. to move, to pass, to go, to walk, to walk about, क्वचित् पथा संचरते सुराणां क्वचिद्वनानां पततां क्वचिच्च R.xiii.19, Na.vi.57; 2. to practise, to perform.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "चर् Caus. (चारयति-ते) 1. to cause to move; 2. to send, to direct; 3. to drive away; 4. to cause to perform; 5. to cause to copulate.With उद्-, to cause to utter or pronounce.With प्र-, to cause to wander about.With वि-, 1. to think, to meditate upon; 2. to estimate, to form an idea of, परेषां आत्मनश्चैव यो विचार्य बलाबलम् Panch.iii.; 3. to discuss.With सम्-, 1. to cause to go about, to lead; 2. to cause to spread; 3. to deliver over to, to transmit, to communicate; 4. to turn out to graze.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "cara": [{"id": "cara", "headword": "चर", "headword_slp1": "cara", "fold": "cara", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "चर (I) a. (f. री) 1. Moving, walking; 2. trembling, shaking; 3. movable, M.iii.201; 4. animate, M.vii.15, (चर when used as an affix means ‘formerly,’ e.g. आढ्यचर ‘formerly rich’, अध्यापकचर ‘late teacher’).", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "चर (II) m. 1. A spy; 2. a wagtail; 3. a game played with dice and men; 4. a cowrie; 5. Tuesday.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["चरः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["caraH"]}, {"id": "cAra", "headword": "चार", "headword_slp1": "cAra", "fold": "cara", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "चार (I) m. 1. A spy, a secret emissary, M.vii.184; 2. motion, course (as in ग्रहचार); 3. going, walking, क्रीडाशैले यदि च विचरेत् पादचारेण गौरी Megh.i.60; 4. performing, practising; 5. a prison.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "चार (II) n. A factitious poison.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["चारं", "चारः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["cAraM", "cAraH"]}], "cari": [{"id": "carI", "headword": "चरी", "headword_slp1": "carI", "fold": "cari", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "चर (I) a. (f. री) 1. Moving, walking; 2. trembling, shaking; 3. movable, M.iii.201; 4. animate, M.vii.15, (चर when used as an affix means ‘formerly,’ e.g. आढ्यचर ‘formerly rich’, अध्यापकचर ‘late teacher’).", "gloss_language": "en"}]}, {"id": "cari", "headword": "चरि", "headword_slp1": "cari", "fold": "cari", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "चरि m. An animal.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["चरिः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["cariH"]}], "caracara": [{"id": "carAcara", "headword": "चराचर", "headword_slp1": "carAcara", "fold": "caracara", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "चर-अचर (I) a. movable and immovable, Bg.xi.43.", "gloss_language": "en"}, {"gloss": "चर-अचर (II) n. 1. the aggregate of all created things, the world, M.i.57, 63; 2. the sky, the atmosphere.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["चराचरं", "चराचरः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["carAcaraM", "carAcaraH"]}], "caradravya": [{"id": "caradravya", "headword": "चरद्रव्य", "headword_slp1": "caradravya", "fold": "caradravya", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "चर-द्रव्य n. a movable thing.", "gloss_language": "en"}]}], "caramurti": [{"id": "caramUrti", "headword": "चरमूर्ति", "headword_slp1": "caramUrti", "fold": "caramurti", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "चर-मूर्ति f. an idol which is carried about in procession.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["चरमूर्तिः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["caramUrtiH"]}], "caraka": [{"id": "caraka", "headword": "चरक", "headword_slp1": "caraka", "fold": "caraka", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "चरक m. 1. A spy; 2. a wandering mendicant.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["चरकः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["carakaH"]}, {"id": "cAraka", "headword": "चारक", "headword_slp1": "cAraka", "fold": "caraka", "headword_language": "sa", "source": "vaidya", "senses": [{"gloss": "चारक m. 1. A spy; 2. a herdsman; 3. an associate; 4. a groom, a cavalier; 5. a prison, निगडितचरणा चारके निरोद्धव्या D.K.", "gloss_language": "en"}], "synonyms": ["चारकः"], "synonyms_slp1": ["cArakaH"]}], "caraw